OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor's social media post
OL,4,Asparks protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 people staged a protest
OL,7,Fover a West Yorkshire Reform UK
OL,8,Fcouncillor's social media comments
OL,9,Fabout immigrants.
OL,11,FIn screenshots of an alleged Facebook
OL,12,Fpost seen by the BBC, Reform councillor
OL,13,Ffor Colne Valley West Tracy Clayton
OL,14,Fused the phrases "invaders" and "third
OL,15,Fworld animals" and claimed there had
OL,16,Fbeen "gang rapes on the beach".
OL,18,FA protest was held outside Huddersfield
OL,19,FTown Hall on Wednesday over the
OL,20,Fcomments, with organiser Nick Ruff of
OL,21,FStand Up To Racism calling for Clayton
OL,22,Fto resign.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
