OL,4,Asparks protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK previously described
OL,7,FClayton's comments as "completely
OL,8,Fcorrect", adding in a statement on
OL,9,FThursday: "Grooming gang perpetrators
OL,10,Fare animals. It's odd that these
OL,11,Fprotesters disagree."
